# Day-to-day: event-driven pub/sub: producers publish to topics; multiple consumers subscribe.
title "Event-driven pub/sub"
dir RIGHT
web[Web checkout]
mobile[Mobile checkout]
t1{orders topic} :yellow
t2{payments topic} :yellow
mail[Email sender]
stock[Stock updater]
fraud[Fraud scorer]
audit[(Audit log)]
web, mobile -> t1 : publish
t1 -> mail : subscribe
t1 -> stock : subscribe
t1 -> fraud : subscribe
fraud -> t2 : score
t2 -> audit
stock -> audit
